PURPOSE: Checks on the profiling process. Verified one-by-one at finish.
001. The exact workload being profiled was identified and actually run.
002. A baseline runtime was recorded.
003. The top bottleneck was identified from real profiling output, not guessed.
004. No optimization was proposed before a measured bottleneck existed.
005. The baseline and profiling_report_id were returned for an optimizer to use.
